From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:12:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: iPad 5 (J72t): Enable the GPU

The cellular iPad 5 has the same GPU as the J71t and, in the same iPadOS
16.7.10 restore image, the same firmware for it: its kernelcache's
AGXFirmwareKextG5P section is byte for byte the J71t's (checked with
orchard.apple.remote_ipsw; sha256 33ae20cb...5dca). Its firmware recipe
installs the file now, so its node is enabled too.

The S8003 phones stay as they are: iOS 15.8.8's kernelcaches for the
N71m, N66m and N69 carry a firmware image of another size, which the
recipe step refuses and whose layout the driver has not been checked
against.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003-j71t.dts | 4 +---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003-j72t.dts | 5 +++++
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003-j71t.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003-j71t.dts
index 4775055..018ad6c 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003-j71t.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003-j71t.dts
@@ -25,9 +25,7 @@
 	brcm,board-type = "apple,feara";
 };
 
-/*
- * The GPU: the powervr driver starts its firmware. It does not render yet.
- */
+/* The GPU: its firmware file comes from this board's firmware recipe */
 &gpu {
 	status = "okay";
 };
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003-j72t.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003-j72t.dts
index bc36459..a3e0dea 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003-j72t.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003-j72t.dts
@@ -24,3 +24,8 @@
 &wifi {
 	brcm,board-type = "apple,fearb";
 };
+
+/* The GPU: its firmware file comes from this board's firmware recipe */
+&gpu {
+	status = "okay";
+};
